JDK
 ↓
Development + Runtime

JRE
 ↓
Runtime Environment

JVM
 ↓
Executes Bytecode
```

Java execution:

```text
.java
  ↓
javac
  ↓
.class
  ↓
Bytecode
  ↓
JVM
  ↓
Interpreter / JIT
  ↓
Native Code
  ↓
CPU
```

---

# ⭐ Golden Interview Line

> **Java is platform independent because Java source code is compiled into platform-independent bytecode, and that bytecode is executed by a platform-specific JVM.**

